  "configuration_id": "config_028",  
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_005/006) and ViT-L image encoder (config_038) yield strong performance. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 RNA with ResNet50 image encoder (config_028) in a singleprofile setup. It isolates the impact of image encoder choice in multimodal settings, addressing uncertainty about whether ResNet50's poor image-only performance (config_010) persists when combined with RNA data. This comparison clarifies the relative importance of image encoder architecture versus RNA modality integration, leveraging the strong RNA baseline while exploring a less effective image encoder."  
}

